  {
   "id": "Pw6OqNn9AAAJ",
   "from": "Reza Norouzian",
   "author": "8f8b5832b9ad8628",
   "date": "2020-05-29T23:42:46Z",
   "subject": "\"Standard Error\" of difference of two effect sizes in lavaan",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello All,<div><br></div><div>In <a href=\"https://stats.stackexchange.com/a/258583/140365\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stats.stackexchange.com/a/258583/140365&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421692179000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2T7-DnNFZz-AcjWLsJKMlC\">this answer</a>, Dr. Cheung demonstrates how to calculate the &quot;Standard Error&quot; of a pre-post effect size using lavaan.</div><div><br></div><div>Suppose, however, we have <i><b>two independent </b></i>pre-post effect sizes: one from a &quot;Control&quot;, another from a &quot;Treatment&quot; group. Then, we subtract and scale them like so:</div><div><br></div><b><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">New.Effect.Size = (M.dif.gr.T/Sd.dif.gr.T) − (M.dif.gr.C /Sd.dif.gr.C) / ((</font><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Sd.dif.gr.C  + Sd.dif.gr.T)/2)</font></b><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><b><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></b></div>where \r\n\r\n<b>M.dif</b> is the difference between the means of pre- and post-tests of each group. And <b>Sd.dif</b> is the standard deviation of the difference scores for each of the two independent groups.  <div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div>I was wondering given <a href=\"https://stats.stackexchange.com/a/258583/140365\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stats.stackexchange.com/a/258583/140365&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421692179000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2T7-DnNFZz-AcjWLsJKMlC\">this answer</a> by Dr. Cheung, how I can calculate the &quot;Standard Error&quot; of my &quot;<b>New.Effect.Size</b>&quot;?</div><div><br></div><div><i>Thank you for your time and consideration, Reza</i></div><div><div><br></div><div><br><b>#== Some input values</b><br><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">n.gr.C = 25<br>n.gr.T = 35 <br>m.dif.gr.C = 25<br>m.dif.gr.T = 31<br>sd.dif.gr.C = 1.1<br>sd.dif.gr.T = 1.7</font><br></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font color=\"#274e13\"><b>Reza Norouzian</b></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"monospace\" color=\"#274e13\">Postdoctoral Research Associate | Lecturer</font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"monospace\" color=\"#274e13\">Second Language Acquisition &amp; Research Methods, </font><span style=\"color:rgb(39,78,19);font-family:monospace;font-size:small\">Ph.D.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(39,78,19);font-family:monospace;letter-spacing:0.2px\">College of Education &amp; Human Development</span><span style=\"color:rgb(39,78,19);font-family:monospace;font-size:small\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(39,78,19);font-family:monospace;font-size:small\">Dep. of Teaching, Learning &amp; Culture | Texas A&amp;M University</span><br></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"monospace\" color=\"#274e13\">College Station, TX 77843</font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"monospace\" color=\"#274e13\">Google Scholar: <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=5B09zr8AAAAJ&amp;hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://scholar.google.com/citations?user%3D5B09zr8AAAAJ%26hl%3Den&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421692179000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mhOU4gEPiQ-IjLPjdSPa6\">HERE</a></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"monospace\" color=\"#274e13\">University Webpage: <a href=\"https://directory.education.tamu.edu/view.epl?nid=rnorouzian\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://directory.education.tamu.edu/view.epl?nid%3Drnorouzian&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421692179000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19lI9VFMgPM8sJgecRf7Qo\">HERE</a></font><font color=\"#0000ee\" face=\"monospace\"><u></u></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"monospace\" color=\"#274e13\">Email: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rnoro...@tamu.edu</a></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"monospace\" color=\"#274e13\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:(979)%20422-7052\" value=\"+19794227052\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(979)-422-7052</a><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#274e13\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><div><b>Future L2 researchers will be challenged not only on the basis of their substantive questions, but also on how they manage to answer those questions in a methodical manner.</b></div></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
