"#274e13\">University Webpage: <a href=\"https://directory.education.tamu.edu/view.epl?nid=rnorouzian\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://directory.education.tamu.edu/view.epl?nid%3Drnorouzian&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421692181000&amp;usg=AOvVaw23MyEfA8GjdgSFO9hU1ryf\">HERE</a></font><font color=\"#0000ee\" face=\"monospace\"><u></u></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"monospace\" color=\"#274e13\">Email: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rnoro...@tamu.edu</a></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"monospace\" color=\"#274e13\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:(979)%20422-7052\" value=\"+19794227052\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(979)-422-7052</a><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#274e13\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><div><b>Future L2 researchers will be challenged not only on the basis of their substantive questions, but also on how they manage to answer those questions in a methodical manner.</b></div></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
